1. **Think/Do Workflow** — Separates reasoning (mutable history, no tool access) from execution (immutable, full tool access, git snapshotting)
2. **Plan-Driven Execution** — Multi-phase plans with dependency graphs, audit gates, and dispatch
3. **Modular Prompt System** — 8 decomposed system prompt sections, all editable as plain `.md` files with config-only overrides
4. **Multi-Provider LLM Support** — Kimi, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, VertexAI, with generation parameters per model
5. **Subagent System** — Task-focused child agents with budget gates (tokens + tool calls)
6. **Multiple UI Modes** — Interactive TUI (shell), non-interactive (print), ACP (IDE integration), Web, Wire protocol
7. **MCP Tool Support** — Load external tools via Model Context Protocol
8. **Built-in Skills** — Reusable capabilities (codex-worker, gen-changelog, gen-docs, translate-docs, feature-smoke-test, etc.)
9. **Monorepo** — With workspace packages for LLM abstraction, OS abstraction, VS Code extension, and SDK[stage] run_soul_finished

